        <mxCell id="YaLXAKDGUNQ4cMJmnPIx-17" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontColor=#000000;" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 35px;&quot;&gt;Si&lt;/font&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 35px;&quot;&gt;,&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Ciudadana, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, Roboto, &amp;quot;Helvetica Neue&amp;quot;, Arial, &amp;quot;Noto Sans&amp;quot;, sans-serif, &amp;quot;Apple Color Emoji&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Emoji&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Symbol&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Noto Color Emoji&amp;quot;; letter-spacing: 0.15008px; text-align: start; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;Sellado: $ 329&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Ciudadana, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, Roboto, &amp;quot;Helvetica Neue&amp;quot;, Arial, &amp;quot;Noto Sans&amp;quot;, sans-serif, &amp;quot;Apple Color Emoji&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Emoji&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Symbol&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Noto Color Emoji&amp;quot;; letter-spacing: 0.15008px; text-align: start; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Ciudadana, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, Roboto, &amp;quot;Helvetica Neue&amp;quot;, Arial, &amp;quot;Noto Sans&amp;quot;, sans-serif, &amp;quot;Apple Color Emoji&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Emoji&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Symbol&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Noto Color Emoji&amp;quot;; letter-spacing: 0.15008px; text-align: start; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;Ejecución: 2 UR&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Ciudadana, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, Roboto, &amp;quot;Helvetica Neue&amp;quot;, Arial, &amp;quot;Noto Sans&amp;quot;, sans-serif, &amp;quot;Apple Color Emoji&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Emoji&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Symbol&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Noto Color Emoji&amp;quot;; letter-spacing: 0.15008px; text-align: start; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Ciudadana, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, Roboto, &amp;quot;Helvetica Neue&amp;quot;, Arial, &amp;quot;Noto Sans&amp;quot;, sans-serif, &amp;quot;Apple Color Emoji&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Emoji&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Symbol&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Noto Color Emoji&amp;quot;; letter-spacing: 0.15008px; text-align: start; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;Regularización: 7 UR (2 UR autorización + 5 UR multa)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Ciudadana, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, Roboto, &amp;quot;Helvetica Neue&amp;quot;, Arial, &amp;quot;Noto Sans&amp;quot;, sans-serif, &amp;quot;Apple Color Emoji&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Emoji&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Symbol&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Noto Color Emoji&amp;quot;; letter-spacing: 0.15008px; text-align: start; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Ciudadana, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, Roboto, &amp;quot;Helvetica Neue&amp;quot;, Arial, &amp;quot;Noto Sans&amp;quot;, sans-serif, &amp;quot;Apple Color Emoji&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Emoji&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Symbol&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Noto Color Emoji&amp;quot;; letter-spacing: 0.15008px; text-align: start; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;Nivelación: solo el sellado&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;" vertex="1">
